From t.jombart at imperial.ac.uk  Tue Sep  7 13:26:41 2010
From: t.jombart at imperial.ac.uk (Jombart, Thibaut)
Date: Tue, 7 Sep 2010 12:26:41 +0100
Subject: [adegenet-forum] Use of Lag spca$ls values.
